{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlgdd573lbk0","created":1789524140973,"text":"SRD检测逻辑"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgddfn3rvs0","created":1789524163709,"text":"BCLK是否正常（有）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgddlisigw0","created":1789524176509,"text":"异常（丢失或者不在合理范围内）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgde0thd880","created":1789524209807,"text":"从Normal->LOST","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgde9ioso80","created":1789524228745,"text":"BCLK丢失，做mode_reinit，关闭时钟跟随","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","background":"#ff0000"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgdejm8ac80","created":1789524250727,"text":"从LOST->Normal","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdeqhnieo0","created":1789524265688,"text":"BCLK恢复","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdf0o1xr40","created":1789524287843,"text":"SRD正常","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdf4g4yuw0","created":1789524296071,"text":"BCLK、和LRCLK都正常，做mode_reinit，打开时钟跟随","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","background":"#00b050"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgdfhyu1bk0","created":1789524325500,"text":"SRD异常","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdflc5y3c0","created":1789524332836,"text":"代表时钟没有完全恢复，什么都不做，继续下一轮检测","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgddnjcjh40","created":1789524180897,"text":"正常","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdfznqw2o0","created":1789524364012,"text":"做SRD检测","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdg6c3yjk0","created":1789524378545,"text":"SRD正常","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdgbah0y00","created":1789524389330,"text":"代表时钟完全正常，什么都不做，继续下一轮检测","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgdg8vefjs0","created":1789524384065,"text":"SRD异常","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdgvdp5940","created":1789524433061,"text":"从Nromal->LOST","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdh821mso0","created":1789524460655,"text":"代表时钟丢了，做mode_reinit，关闭时钟跟随","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","background":"#ff0000"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgdh1hi2aw0","created":1789524446352,"text":"从LOST->Normal","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgdhg2xa140","created":1789524478122,"text":"代表时钟恢复了，做mode_reinit，打开时钟跟随","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","background":"#00b050"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgee0ai21s0","created":1789527029769,"text":"问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgefl2rt0w0","created":1789527153378,"text":"1、在BCLK和LRCLK都稳定的情况下，周期性的检测不到SRD    PASS✅️"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgeg2a7im00","created":1789527190833,"text":"怀疑1：检测留的时间余量不够？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgegk4jwfs0","created":1789527229673,"text":"将检测周期从50修改为80❌️"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgegj0qpg00","created":1789527227266,"text":"怀疑2：和当前的group有无关系？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgeixtiem80","created":1789527416209,"text":"将group0切换到group2❌️"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgejcbb8680","created":1789527447760,"text":"怀疑3：和当前的SRD检测寄存器配置有无关系？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgejkhvxhc0","created":1789527465572,"text":"可能有关系，将CHW_TH扩大之后会有一点效果✅️"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgexwaeix40","created":1789528588339,"text":"怀疑4：单板问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgf09z4pco0","created":1789528774861,"text":"有可能，我换了一块单板，跑10分钟，都没有看到异常检测成0的情况"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgf0x34x400","created":1789528825169,"text":"怀疑5：和TDM数有无关系"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgf12i4kmw0","created":1789528836959,"text":"肯定是有的，TDM16、32复现的概率明显要高一些"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgfhtpc29s0","created":1789530149995,"text":"2、单独enableRX0没有问题，当Enable了TX0后，周期性检查不到SRD    PASS✅️"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgfida8ee00","created":1789530192617,"text":"怀疑1：和TX0使用的Group时钟组有无关系\n应该无关❌️"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgfj3ootww0","created":1789530250088,"text":"1、TX disable掉时，RX可以正常检测，无误报"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlgfn188abc0","created":1789530558196,"text":"2、将TX配置成G1时，存在SRD检测不到的情况"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlgfnhbno2g0","created":1789530593232,"text":"3、将TX配置成G2时，也同样存在"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgfpey5wdk0","created":1789530744790,"text":"怀疑2：和做Slave和Master有无关系"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgfpl0lh280","created":1789530757998,"text":"1、做Slave时，BCLK可以检测到RX的频率、检测不到TX的频率，但是用逻辑分析仪是可以检测到TX有BCLK时钟的"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlgfu54jons0","created":1789531115229,"text":"2、做Master时，RX的BCLK可以正常检测，TX的BCLK没有调用检测。\n且RX的SRD检测，会时不时的检测出0"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgir17zts00","created":1789539334968,"text":"怀疑3：是不是驱动配置和我SRD配置冲突了"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgir8iblco0","created":1789539350830,"text":"1、phy_audio_i2stx.c"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgjn82x7j40","created":1789541857552,"text":"最终发现和我是否enableTX没有关系，实际是只有我LRCLK接入了上游的LRCLK，好像就会产生污染，这个具体要再研究下    ✅️"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgp1bjgmns0","created":1789557067730,"text":"3、貌似在丢失时，可能会概率性出现复位两次的情况"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgp30nnp1c0","created":1789557200768,"text":"怀疑1：没做消抖动"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlh9l6rqjvk0","created":1789615046828,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgf998105s0","created":1789529478500,"text":"测试项目"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgf9bj45ns0","created":1789529483524,"text":"1、上游整机掉电和恢复"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgf9kh3iko0","created":1789529502993,"text":"PASS✅️能检测到LOST和恢复"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgf9qhp8g80","created":1789529516090,"text":"2、上游BCLK丢失和恢复"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgfa0xe4000","created":1789529538806,"text":"PASS✅️能检测到LOST和恢复"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgf9vlvhgg0","created":1789529527226,"text":"3、上游单独LRCLK丢失和恢复"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgfa3oqgps0","created":1789529544813,"text":"PASS✅️能检测到LOST和恢复"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgfcmfra000","created":1789529742358,"text":"4、对音频输入输出的影响"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlgoz2273j40","created":1789556890367,"text":"PASS✅️，配置1565A TX->RX 258x- TX> RX 1565B，这种三版验证环境，1565B的RX可以正常收到音频"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlh8bvv9odk0","created":1789611496710,"text":"HALF PASS✅️❌️同样三版环境，1565B进行，录音，观察时钟检测过程中丢失和恢复时对音频的影响\n观察到存在两次复位情况"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlgp3agtuvk0","created":1789557222123,"text":"5、TDM32时的表现情况"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}